  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Impact Cluster: Potato Bangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">One of the major problems in the potato production in Bangladesh is the high post-harvest losses resulting from improper harvesting, cleaning, grading, bagging, transportation, processing and storage. The aim of this Impact Cluster project was to demonstrate how growers and their supply chain partners can add value to their produce and improve their incomes based on a business-oriented and integrated supply chain approach and delivered impact in terms of:&#x2022;	Reduced post-harvest losses and new developed marketing opportunities that positively affected net income levels of potato growers and traders;&#x2022;	Enhanced local capacities on cultivation and post-harvest practices that positively affected potato productivity, post-harvest losses and food security.</narrative>
  </description>
